~ Search Restaurant 

Test Scenarios :-

Functional Test Scenarios:-

1. Verify that the user can search for a restaurant using a valid restaurant name.

2. Verify that the search displays relevant restaurants when the user enters a partial restaurant name.

3. Verify that the system displays "No results found" when the user searches for a restaurant that does not exist.

4. Verify that the user can search restaurants using different food categary such as Pizza, Chinese, or Indian.

5. Verify that the user can apply filters such as rating, price, and food category and get the correct results.

6. Verify that the search results are updated correctly when the user removes or changes the applied filters.

Non-Functional Test Scenarios :-

7. Verify that search results are displayed within an acceptable response time after entering a search query.

8. Verify that the search feature works properly on different screen sizes and devices.

9. Verify that the search screen and results are displayed properly without UI overlapping or broken elements.

10. Verify that the app does not freeze or crash when the user performs multiple searches continuously.
